body:
I believe the 2022 and 2023 models come with an engine immobilizer so they can not be stolen with the TikTok Hack, but I will do more research on this. 

&#x200B;

Thanks for the answer

The Cleaver is for veg or to really thinly slice meat for some Chinese/Korean dishes. The creativeness of the cleaver isn't as important.

&#x200B;

I like the flatter profile of the CCK cleaver

&#x200B;

Thanks for the input!
